{
    "test_name": "MOB.397_Work_Assign_Followup",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.397_Work_Assign_Followup",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.397` **Assign Follow-up Work** from a work-order collection item's gear menu.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **LEAVES RESIDUE**: creates a real work order per run. Approved 2026-08-12.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **The same gear menu contains `Delete Item`.** Mobile is delete-free (trap 2), so\n  the entry is matched by **exact text**, never by position or `contains()`. Keep it\n  that way if this test is ever edited.\n- Uses the **Assets** tab: `hideFollowUpWork` suppresses the action on `jobNotes`,\n  `condition` and `failures`, so those tabs cannot exercise it.\n- Tabs are asserted by NAME here \u2014 MOB.330 only ever switched them positionally, so this\n  is also the first test to pin that the fixture has an `Assets` tab.\n- \ud83d\udc1e **Guarded against bugs \u00a745**: expanding an asset row before the Asset schema is cached\n  crashes the page. It opens `Add Existing Asset` and closes it unused (that loads the\n  schema), then gates on every row's geolocate control before expanding.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "CRUD",
            "residue",
            "module:work-orders"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                },
                {
                    "name": "RUNID",
                    "type": "text",
                    "pattern": "{{ numeric(8) }}",
                    "example": "48120735"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
